428
00:44:44,240 --> 00:44:48,840
" Oh nightly star ! "

429
00:44:49,880 --> 00:44:54,720
" You shimmer on this night ! "

430
00:44:55,480 --> 00:45:00,360
" Whom do you seek ... "

431
00:45:00,840 --> 00:45:03,600
" Within me ? "

